{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/WhosTheGoodBoy.gif?t=1748387608\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Have you ever wondered how similar our dog's life is to that of an RPG game? Well, I did.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is inspired by my real-life dog, <strong>Ramon</strong>. He\u2019s a small Shih Tzu with a big imagination! He loves playing with his toys\u2014uh, I mean, weapons. Sometimes, he enjoys fetching ranged weapons (like a good ol\u2019 ball); other times, he prefers melee combat with sticks and bones. Oh, and he even has some stylish outfits\u2014oops, I mean armor\u2014to keep him safe from the harsh environment!<strong>\u00a0</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/GatherResources.png?t=1748387608\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/ImproveYourGear.gif?t=1748387608\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/extras/About_the_Game_-_04.gif?t=1748387608\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3524950?t=1748387608","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/0ffb581dab386110bee2bb1d501cf6d0fc8ad346/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748387608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/9a753c9f8b1dc64684279e490f1f433e39d62b26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748387608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524950/9a753c9f8b1dc64684279e490f1f433e39d62b26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748387608","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achie